--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 38b9ceca75ea97d458c11e0633bbd393, type: 3}
  m_Name: D1_Warmindo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: '*Nanti malem makan rendang kali ya, apa soto?*'
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: '*Hari ini pengen yang berkuah sih,*'
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: '*Yaudah nanti beli yang rebus aja lumayan bikin makin kenyang juga*'
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: (Tiba-tiba seseorang duduk di samping dia)
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cb95e0dfcf6ebbb44b50cee3e89d00cc, type: 2}
  - text: Misi mas, sini kosong kan?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c7b657d32e600b54daa9fc1381300a9c, type: 2}
  - text: "Oh iya, silahkan \u2014"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: Loh,
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: Bang Sakha?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: Lah,
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb619b1bdc32f27479d1fc9c8e310caf, type: 2}
  - text: Ujang.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb619b1bdc32f27479d1fc9c8e310caf, type: 2}
  - text: Kok disini?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb619b1bdc32f27479d1fc9c8e310caf, type: 2}
  - text: (Sakha duduk di samping Ujang)
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cb95e0dfcf6ebbb44b50cee3e89d00cc, type: 2}
  - text: "Hehe\u2026 Iya nih, bang."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: Niatnya mau ngerantau cari duit,
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: Eh ga dapet mulu,
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: Mana sering ketipu.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: Walah, Jang..
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb619b1bdc32f27479d1fc9c8e310caf, type: 2}
  - text: Kok bisa ketipu?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb619b1bdc32f27479d1fc9c8e310caf, type: 2}
  - text: Emang ngga cek dulu?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb619b1bdc32f27479d1fc9c8e310caf, type: 2}
  - text: "Ya\u2026keburu pengen kerja,bang."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: Kirain kalo ngerantau disini bakal bisa gampang cari kerja.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: Apa gegara aku pake duit bapak diem diem ya, jadinya sial mulu.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: Hah?!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb619b1bdc32f27479d1fc9c8e310caf, type: 2}
  - text: "Astaga\u2026"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb619b1bdc32f27479d1fc9c8e310caf, type: 2}
  - text: Kamu harus balikin duitnya itu.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb619b1bdc32f27479d1fc9c8e310caf, type: 2}
  - text: Kalo udah dapet kerja ya bakal gitu, bang.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: Kalo sekarang gimana mau balikin,
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: Makan aja cuma bisa mikir nanti makan mie rasa apa
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: '(Sakha berpikir sejenak sebelum menepuk pundak Ujang) '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cb95e0dfcf6ebbb44b50cee3e89d00cc, type: 2}
  - text: Gini, kamu ga masalah kan mau kerja apa aja?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb619b1bdc32f27479d1fc9c8e310caf, type: 2}
  - text: Ya gapapa si, bang.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: Asal ngga bikin nyawa ilang aja
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: "Ya ngga lah\u2026"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb619b1bdc32f27479d1fc9c8e310caf, type: 2}
  - text: Kayaknya.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb619b1bdc32f27479d1fc9c8e310caf, type: 2}
  - text: Abis ini ikut aku deh, mumpung lagi butuh temen kerja juga nih.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb619b1bdc32f27479d1fc9c8e310caf, type: 2}
  - text: Waduh, jangan yang aneh aneh tapi bang.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: Udah cukup kena harapan palsu sebulan ini.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ac3d55cf39c704458e1bfb061f38222, type: 2}
  - text: Aman, kita makan dulu abis tu ikut ke tempat kerjaku deh
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb619b1bdc32f27479d1fc9c8e310caf, type: 2}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 816161cc9b6b36a4f96f6b9c7a71dc39, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67b06fe7578ded646942f49542769764, type: 2}
